Description: HAGRA (하그라) desktop environment — shell, settings, themes, session
 A modern Korean desktop environment on Wayland (labwc): panel and launcher
 (hagra-shell), Settings application (hagra-settings), theme packs
 (연한·깊은·밤 단청), HagraUI QML design system, session scripts and
 labwc configuration.
